fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"unixfd/unixfdsink.html#unixfdsink:wait-for-connection","fragment":"\n\twait-for-connection\n\nBlock the stream until a least one client is connected.\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tConstruct\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\tfalse\n\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});